{"pages":[{"h":792,"ocr":false,"segs":[["E L E M E N TS",43.841199999999994,609.60839999999996,57.071200000000005,649.06039999999996,7,false],["O F",43.841200000000001,596.28039999999999,57.071200000000005,606.63339999999994,7,false],["A W E E K LY",43.841200000000001,555.91840000000002,57.071200000000005,593.30539999999996,7,false],["M E E T I N G 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,552.94340000000011,9,false],["MAIN ELEMENTS OF A",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,536.62000000000012,116.00059999999996,80,false],["WEEKLY MEETING",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,466.86000000000001,176.00059999999996,80,false],["student linc",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,289.94,194.10059999999999,20,false],["What follows is a list of ideas that you can use in a",145.40000000000001,224.88939999999991,333.11300000000017,237.29139999999995,9,false],["weekly meeting on your campus. Not everything",145.40000000000001,237.88539999999989,327.69500000000016,250.28739999999993,9,false],["would be appropriate for every campus situation but",145.40000000000001,250.88139999999987,343.7600000000001,263.28339999999992,9,false],["some of these elements might work for your meeting.",145.40000000000001,263.87739999999985,345.99200000000008,276.2793999999999,9,false],["Of course this list is not exhaustive but it will help get",145.40000000000001,276.87339999999995,347.40500000000009,289.27539999999993,9,false],["you started.",145.40000000000001,289.86939999999993,190.08500000000001,302.27139999999991,9,false],["CELEMENTS OF A WEEKLY MEETING",145.40000000000001,322.27439999999996,302.36000000000001,342.81439999999998,20,false],["Prayer",145.40000000000001,354.5564,174.43399999999997,367.93939999999998,9,false],["Have people share recent answers to prayer. One",145.40000000000001,367.88539999999995,329.14400000000012,380.28739999999993,9,false],["campus has students come to the front and place a",145.40000000000001,380.88139999999993,335.24600000000009,393.28339999999992,9,false],["marble in a glass bowl representing their answer to",145.40000000000001,393.87739999999991,338.36900000000003,406.2793999999999,9,false],["prayer and then shares it with the group.",145.40000000000001,406.87339999999989,298.24700000000007,419.27539999999988,9,false],["Worship Time",369.20300000000003,224.47039999999981,429.88100000000003,237.85339999999985,9,false],["Word Time",369.20300000000003,250.47139999999979,416.78600000000006,263.85439999999983,9,false],["Speaker, Bible study discussion, small groups, speaker",369.20300000000003,263.80039999999974,574.01600000000008,276.20239999999978,9,false],["facilitated discussion, group talks.",369.20300000000003,276.79639999999984,498.54200000000003,289.19839999999982,9,false],["Spotlights",369.20300000000003,302.46439999999984,413.34800000000001,315.84739999999982,9,false],["A short segment (about 3-6 minutes) highlighting a",369.20300000000003,315.79339999999979,562.80200000000013,328.19539999999978,9,false],["recent story, aspect of the ministry, ministry idea, etc.",369.20300000000003,328.78939999999977,571.89200000000017,341.19139999999976,9,false],["•",369.20300000000003,341.78539999999975,373.34300000000002,354.18739999999974,9,false],["Evangelism stories",387.20300000000003,341.78539999999998,459.779,354.18739999999997,9,false],["•",369.20299999999997,354.78139999999996,373.34299999999996,367.18339999999995,9,false],["Highlighting subcultures on campus as people",387.20300000000003,354.78139999999996,562.10900000000004,367.18340000000001,9,false],["to reach out to - video and interview people",387.20299999999997,367.77739999999994,550.49000000000001,380.17939999999993,9,false],["from that group. For example athletes, artists,",387.20299999999997,380.77339999999992,559.82300000000009,393.17539999999991,9,false],["international students, Hispanics, etc.",387.20299999999997,393.76939999999991,531.83299999999997,406.17139999999989,9,false],["•",369.20299999999997,406.76539999999989,373.34299999999996,419.16739999999987,9,false],["Short training on some ministry aspect. For",387.20300000000003,406.7654,552.63200000000006,419.16739999999999,9,false],["example, “how to connect with someone in class.”",387.20299999999997,419.76139999999998,574.70000000000005,432.16339999999997,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,432.87439999999987,149.54000000000002,445.27639999999985,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,445.87039999999996,149.54000000000002,458.27239999999995,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,458.86639999999994,149.54000000000002,471.26839999999993,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,484.85839999999996,149.54000000000002,497.26039999999995,9,false],["Concert of prayer meeting.",163.40000000000001,432.87439999999998,265.01900000000001,445.27639999999997,9,false],["Prayer walking time during the meeting.",163.40000000000001,445.87039999999996,316.04000000000008,458.2724,9,false],["Have students break up into small groups and",163.40000000000001,458.8664,335.84900000000005,471.26839999999999,9,false],["share prayer requests and pray for each other.",163.40000000000001,471.86239999999998,335.92100000000011,484.26439999999997,9,false],["Have a prayer time before the meeting to pray for",163.40000000000001,484.85839999999996,348.68300000000011,497.2604,9,false],["your movement and the meeting to follow.",163.40000000000001,497.85439999999994,322.52000000000004,510.25639999999993,9,false],["Gather Names of New People",145.40000000000001,523.52239999999983,267.32299999999998,536.90539999999987,9,false],["Pass around a clipboard each meeting to gather the",145.40000000000001,536.8513999999999,337.62200000000013,549.25339999999994,9,false],["names and info of new people. Have someone give",145.40000000000001,549.84739999999988,333.78800000000012,562.24939999999992,9,false],["them a call that week and add their name to your",145.40000000000001,562.84339999999997,328.55900000000008,575.2453999999999,9,false],["campus email list.",145.40000000000001,575.83939999999996,214.10599999999999,588.24139999999989,9,false],["Connection Time (Meet & Greet)",145.40000000000001,601.50739999999996,278.40199999999999,614.8904,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,614.83639999999991,149.54000000000002,627.23839999999996,9,false],["Ice breaker question",163.40000000000001,614.83639999999991,241.45699999999999,627.23839999999996,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,627.83240000000001,149.54000000000002,640.23439999999994,9,false],["Game",163.40000000000001,627.83240000000001,185.95400000000001,640.23440000000005,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,640.82839999999999,149.54000000000002,653.23040000000003,9,false],["Artistic expression thing – For example, draw a",163.40000000000001,640.82839999999999,341.97800000000007,653.23040000000003,9,false],["picture that represents your last week and share",163.40000000000003,653.82439999999997,345.68600000000015,666.22640000000001,9,false],["it in small groups.",163.40000000000003,666.82039999999995,230.69300000000004,679.22239999999999,9,false],["•",145.40000000000003,679.81639999999993,149.54000000000002,692.21839999999997,9,false],["Have people pair up during the meeting to have",163.40000000000001,679.81639999999993,341.56400000000008,692.21839999999997,9,false],["lunch or coffee sometime during the week.",163.40000000000001,692.81240000000003,323.80700000000002,705.21439999999996,9,false],["•",145.40000000000001,705.80840000000001,149.54000000000002,718.21039999999994,9,false],["Go out to lunch or some other activity together",163.40000000000001,705.80839999999989,340.21400000000006,718.21039999999994,9,false],["right after the meeting.",163.40000000000003,718.80439999999999,250.95200000000003,731.20639999999992,9,false],["Announcements \/ Opportunities",369.20299999999997,445.42939999999999,507.19999999999999,458.81239999999997,9,false],["Pass out calendar. Pass out phone\/email list.",369.20299999999997,458.75839999999994,536.45900000000006,471.16039999999992,9,false],["•",369.20299999999997,471.75439999999992,373.3429999